  "title": "SARS-CoV-2 full-length spike glycoprotein, open state: all-atom MD",
  "description": "All-atom MD simulations of the full-length SARS-CoV-2 spike glycoprotein in the open state (chain A RBD 'up'), protein + glycans only (not aligned). PSF and DCD files are provided. 6 replicas; replicas 4-6 were run with adaptive sampling.",
  "size_gb": 36.87,
